==Description==
'''LET'S GOOO''' is a sticker obtained from General II rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

==Appearance==
The sticker shows the red team variant of the [[Champion Templar]] with its mask open screaming. It plays a sound of the [[Champion Templar]] screaming when used.

==Trivia==
*This sticker is based on the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/lets-fucking-go-ball Let's Fucking Go Ball] reaction image.

